miles_plugins (DeepSeek-V4 model plugin, kernel-free)
=====================================================

Part of this directory is taken from radixark/miles
(https://github.com/radixark/miles), commit
5400905d59d4c03ed7a8fd559b287e4337ff3897, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in LICENSE.miles next to this file. The
upstream repository ships no NOTICE file of its own.

The import path `miles_plugins.models.deepseek_v4.*` is kept unchanged so that the
call sites in the patched Megatron (../../megatron/megatron_dsv4.patch) resolve
against this directory instead of an installed miles.

