  miles_plugins/__init__.py
  miles_plugins/models/__init__.py
  miles_plugins/models/dsa_topk.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/__init__.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/__init__.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/compressor.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/cp_utils.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/rope.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/v4_indexer.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/kernel/__init__.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/kernel/precision_aligned_ops.py

Files modified from upstream (each carries a header comment saying so):

  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4.py
      The grouped `wo_a` einsum is replaced by one plain GEMM per group. The
      batched form reads past the end of its allocation on gfx950 once the
      sequence exceeds about 2040 tokens.
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/qat.py
      `tile_kernels.quant.per_token_cast_back` is replaced by a stub that raises.
      Only reachable with FP8 QAT on.
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/utils.py
      Falls back to the PyTorch Hadamard transform (../../hadamard_torch.py) when
      fast_hadamard_transform is absent, and re-exports
      `wrapped_precompute_freqs_cis` from ops/rope.py for the patched dsa.py.

Files replaced entirely by forwarding stubs (written for this example; same file
names as upstream, no upstream code):

  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/hyper_connection.py   -> ../../mhc_shim.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/kernel/act_quant.py   (raises; FP8 QAT only)
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/kernel/tilelang_indexer_fwd.py -> ../../indexer_torch.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/kernel/tilelang_sparse_mla.py  -> ../../sparse_mqa_torch.py

The stubs locate the replacement modules relative to their own file, by walking up
to the parent directory of `vendored/`. Keep that layout if you move the tree.

Upstream files that are deliberately not included (tilelang kernels, unused here):

  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/kernel/tilelang_indexer.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/kernel/tilelang_indexer_bwd.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/kernel/tilelang_sparse_mla_bwd.py
  miles_plugins/models/deepseek_v4/ops/kernel/tilelang_sparse_mla_fwd.py
